  "decision_target_date": "21/01/2022",
  "subdivision_of_building": "The development proposes the formal division of the application site into two plots, retaining the existing original dwellinghouse and changing the use of an outbuilding that is ancillary to this into a new 1 bedroom / 1 person dwellinghouse (bungalow), accessed via Parish Gate Drive.\n\nThe site has a significant original shift of gradient 1.6m down from the patio connecting with the house which is the same for other houses along this stretch of Bexley Road. The proposed change of use concerns the land at the southern and lower part of the site. The proposal would deliver the upper land exclusively to the house and lower land to the bungalow (existing outbuilding).",
